## Structured data feeds

Prefer these over scraping the HTML — they are generated from the same source
as the pages and stay current.

- [Upcoming events as JSON]({{ site.url }}/events.json): schema.org ItemList of Event objects, with dates, prices, age ranges, and registration links.
- [Upcoming events as iCalendar]({{ site.url }}/events.ics): subscribable calendar feed (RFC 5545).
- [Upcoming events as RSS]({{ site.url }}/feed.xml): standard RSS 2.0.
- [Sitemap]({{ site.url }}/sitemap.xml): every indexable page.

Every event page also carries schema.org `Event` JSON-LD inline, and
`/reservations/` carries `Service`, `OfferCatalog`, and `FAQPage`.

## Pages

- [Home]({{ site.url }}/): store overview, next event, hours, and location.
- [Events & Story Hours]({{ site.url }}/events/): full listing of upcoming and past events, grouped by month. Free Saturday story times run weekly.
- [Book Our Space]({{ site.url }}/reservations/): private event space rental — birthday parties, baby showers, book clubs. Three packages, capacity about 30 seated or 50 standing. Inquiry form; pricing quoted per event.
- [Our Story]({{ site.url }}/about/): how the store was founded, and by whom.
- [Press & Media]({{ site.url }}/press/): press releases, media kit, and store information.
- [Newsletter]({{ site.url }}/signup/): email list signup.

